Jan — https://github.com/janhq/jan
Copyright 2025 Menlo Research
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Jan is the reference open-source local-LLM desktop application MISAKA Studio was
designed against. Specifically, the following were taken from Jan as prior art
and re-implemented here:

  * the overall shape of a local-LLM desktop app — a Tauri shell over a web UI,
    with the inference engine supervised as a separate process rather than linked
    into the application;
  * serving an OpenAI-compatible API on localhost as the app's own primary
    interface, so third-party clients and the app's UI use the same surface;
  * managing GGUF models by downloading them from the Hugging Face Hub into a
    user-configurable model directory.

**No Jan source code is included in this tree.** Every file under `misaka-studio/`
was written for this repository: the runtime is Rust (Jan's is TypeScript over a
Tauri core), the model store, catalog client, backend abstraction, provenance
layer and UI are MISAKA's own. Attribution is given here because Jan's Apache-2.0
NOTICE requests it for user-facing materials, and because the design debt is real
whether or not any code moved.

Should Jan source ever be vendored into this tree, it must land under
`misaka-studio/third_party/jan/` with Jan's LICENSE and NOTICE files intact, each
modified file carrying a change notice, as Apache-2.0 section 4 requires.

