MISAKA Studio's default backend runs llama.cpp's `llama-server` as a child
process. No llama.cpp source or binary is contained in or distributed with this
tree; the Studio locates an engine the user installed, or one a packaged build
ships beside the executable. A distribution that does bundle `llama-server` must
include llama.cpp's MIT licence text with it.

