--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Hugging Face Hub
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Model search and downloads use the public Hugging Face Hub HTTP API. Models
downloaded through it carry their own licences, which are the user's to accept —
the Studio records the repository and revision it fetched from so the licence
that applies can always be identified.

