What was deliberately NOT used
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

LM Studio and other closed-source local-LLM applications. No part of this work
derives from their code, their protocols, or from reverse-engineering them.
Where MISAKA Studio and such products share a feature, it is because both solve
the same problem for the same users.
